{"unit_id":"Dogtiti__dsh-provider-icons#card-zh","repo":"Dogtiti/dsh-provider-icons","commit":"d98ab0914e1eab7bb1362044d755d58795639912","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-provider-icons 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页客户端的界面插件，会在模型选择器中模型名称旁显示供应商品牌标记。它通过读取选择器元素上的 provider id 注入 CSS 伪元素，为已知厂商显示内联图标，并支持别名和供应商前缀匹配；未识别的供应商显示灰色圆点。适合希望在模型菜单和当前模型标签中快速辨认模型服务来源的用户。图标作为内联数据随插件提供，无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:72-93","client.js:96-104","package.json:47-53"]}
{"unit_id":"Dogtiti__dsh-provider-icons#card-en","repo":"Dogtiti/dsh-provider-icons","commit":"d98ab0914e1eab7bb1362044d755d58795639912","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-provider-icons adds provider marks beside model names in the DeepSeek Harness web selector. CSS rules use embedded logos, aliases and provider-prefix matches; unknown providers keep a gray dot. It helps users identify a model's service without extra configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:72-93","client.js:96-104","package.json:47-53"]}
